  "source": "Segment start times from the owner's Whisper run (2026-10-29); text is the English script for each segment.",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 6,
      "text": " ILP keeps the legal side of your life abroad in order, in six countries, for one monthly fee."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 6,
      "end": 13,
      "text": " Living abroad comes with legal dates written in another language, and nobody sends you a reminder."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 13,
      "end": 18,
      "text": " Start with a free two-minute check, and join when you want a lawyer to look at what it found."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 18,
      "end": 26,
      "text": " Next to a typical fifteen hundred dollar retainer, ILP is seventy-nine dollars and ninety-nine cents a month, with your lawyer calls included."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 26,
      "end": 33,
      "text": " A late filing can bring a fine, and asking around rarely gives you one clear answer."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 33,
      "end": 38,
      "text": " Your lawyer reads your file before each call, so your twenty minutes go straight to your question."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 38,
      "end": 45,
      "text": " Most questions look like these: a residency card coming up for renewal, or a company tax you had never heard of."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 45,
      "end": 53,
      "text": " Colombia, Costa Rica, Mexico, Panama, Portugal and Spain are all open, each with lawyers licensed there."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 53,
      "end": 56,
      "text": " Pick your country and take the free check. It takes about two minutes."
    }
  ],
